// Kbooks. A bookkeeping system that never goes offline.
// Build from this folder: scroll build

title Kbooks
description A bookkeeping system that never goes offline. State of the art software decades ahead of SQL databases. And yet, works great with pen and paper too.
keywords Kbooks, bookkeeping, scrollsets, Knowbooks, orders, expenses, pen and paper
baseUrl https://knowbooks.com/s/kbooks/
canonicalUrl https://knowbooks.com/s/kbooks/
openGraphImage og.png
favicon favicon.svg
permalink index.html
htmlLang en
buildHtml
metaTags

header
 a Knowbooks
  href ../index.html
  addClass brand
 a Source
  href https://github.com/breck7/knowbooks.com/tree/main/s/kbooks
  addClass header-link

main
 p Bookkeeping
  addClass eyebrow
 h1 Kbooks
 p A bookkeeping system that never goes offline.
  addClass lede
 p State of the art software decades ahead of SQL databases. And yet, works great with pen and paper too.
  addClass dek
 div
  class slips
  a Orders
   href order.html
   class slip-order
   span Print the order slips
    class slip-note
  a Expenses
   href expense.html
   class slip-expense
   span Print the expense slips
    class slip-note
 p
  addClass video-wrap
  a Watch the video explanation
   href https://videos.knowbooks.com/#kbooksBookkeepingSystem
   addClass video
 section
  addClass scrollsets
  h2 Scrollsets
  p A scrollset is a plain text file. Each record is a short block of lines like <code>name Ada</code> and <code>items 2 knowbooks</code>. The parsers — the schema — live in the same file. You can read it on paper, diff it, and version it with git. It never goes offline, and it compiles to JSON, CSV, or HTML when you want that.
  p Kbooks uses the same fields on the printed order and expense slips, so the paper and the file stay in sync.

footer
 p Kbooks · Knowbooks
 a More free software
  href ../index.html

css
 :root {
  --paper: #f4efe5;
  --ink: #20211e;
  --muted: #706b61;
  --line: rgba(32, 33, 30, .16);
  --red: #c23a2c;
  --white: #fffdf8;
  --gold: #d9bc78;
 }
 * { box-sizing: border-box; }
 html { background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); }
 body { margin: 0 auto; max-width: 760px; padding: 0 28px; font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; line-height: 1.5; }
 a { color: inherit; }
 header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding: 24px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
 .brand { text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; font: 700 11px/1 Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .2em; }
 .header-link { text-decoration: none; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; font: 700 10px/1 Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .13em; }
 .header-link:hover, .header-link:focus-visible { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
 main { padding: 72px 0 64px; }
 .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 22px; color: var(--red); text-transform: uppercase; font: 700 10px/1 Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .2em; }
 h1 { margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: clamp(64px, 14vw, 112px); font-weight: 400; line-height: .9; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
 .lede { max-width: 22ch; margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
 .dek { max-width: 34em; margin: 0 0 40px; color: var(--muted); font-size: clamp(18px, 2.2vw, 22px); line-height: 1.5; }
 .slips { display: grid; gap: 16px; margin: 0 0 36px; }
 @media (min-width: 640px) { .slips { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
 .slip-order, .slip-expense { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; min-height: 160px; padding: 28px 26px; border-radius: 18px; text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 36px); letter-spacing: -.03em; }
 .slip-order { background: var(--white); color: var(--ink); }
 .slip-expense { background: var(--red); color: var(--white); border-color: var(--red); }
 .slip-order:hover, .slip-order:focus-visible, .slip-expense:hover, .slip-expense:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--gold); outline-offset: 4px; }
 .slip-note { margin-top: 18px; font: 700 11px/1 Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .8; }
 .video-wrap { margin: 0 0 64px; }
 .video { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--red); }
 .video:hover, .video:focus-visible { color: var(--red); }
 .scrollsets { padding: 56px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
 h2 { margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 40px); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
 .scrollsets p { max-width: 38em; margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 20px); line-height: 1.55; color: var(--ink); }
 .scrollsets p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--muted); }
 code { font: 0.92em/1.4 ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; background: var(--white); padding: .12em .35em; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
 footer { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; padding: 26px 0 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font: 12px/1.5 Arial, sans-serif; }
 footer p { margin: 0; }
 footer a { color: var(--muted); }
 a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--gold); outline-offset: 4px; }
 @media (max-width: 560px) { body { padding: 0 18px; } main { padding: 48px 0 44px; } .slip-order, .slip-expense { min-height: 132px; } }
